OL,3,AOrganised crime arrests in A66 crash
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve people have been arrested as
OL,7,Fpart of the investigation into the A66
OL,8,Fcrash that killed seven people,
OL,9,Fincluding two police officers.
OL,11,FNine men and three women, aged between
OL,12,F19 and 61, have been arrested across
OL,13,FTeesside on suspicion of a range of
OL,14,Foffences including possession of a
OL,15,Ffirearm and being part of an organised
OL,16,Fcrime group.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
