OL,3,ABurnham vows support for Ukraine
OL,4,Adespite 'outrageous threats' from
OL,5,ARussia
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has promised to keep up
OL,8,Fthe pressure on Russia despite Moscow's
OL,9,F"outrageous threats", on his first
OL,10,Fofficial visit to Ukraine as UK prime
OL,11,Fminister.
OL,13,FBurnham met Ukrainian President
OL,14,FVolodymyr Zelensky and chaired his
OL,15,Ffirst meeting of the "coalition of the
OL,16,Fwilling", set up by the UK and France
OL,17,Funder his predecessor Sir Keir Starmer.
OL,19,FHe said the coalition was "doing
OL,20,Feverything we can" while urging the US
OL,21,FCongress to "ratchet up" economic
OL,22,Fpressure on Russia.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
